; A small solid prop (rock, stump, bush, pot) with an upright cylinder as collision.
; Low models with gentle slopes, used with collision_from_model, made the navigation mesh
; climb onto their tops, and the capybara got stuck pushing against them. Straight, tall
; walls keep the top out of reach, so paths always go around. Pick the model per instance.

